From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Denk <tim.denk@zymtrace.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:26:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] add muffin to the std fs, fd and errno lists

muffin has readdir but no readdir_r, readv, writev, openat or FIOCLEX.
std reads directories with readdir, writes vectored I/O one buffer at a
time, sets cloexec with fcntl and binds errno to __errno_location.
The max_iov list is sorted only up to nuttx, so muffin goes at its sorted
place in that part.

